Subject: [PATCH 8/9] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...reProtocol where Self is ~Copyable, Element is Copyable.swift} | 0
 .../{Store.Protocol+Deinitialize.swift => __StoreProtocol.swift}  | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Store/{Store.Protocol+Copy.swift => __StoreProtocol where Self is ~Copyable, Element is Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Store/{Store.Protocol+Deinitialize.swift => __StoreProtocol.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Store/Store.Protocol+Copy.swift b/Sources/Store/__StoreProtocol where Self is ~Copyable, Element is Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Store/Store.Protocol+Copy.swift
rename to Sources/Store/__StoreProtocol where Self is ~Copyable, Element is Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Store/Store.Protocol+Deinitialize.swift b/Sources/Store/__StoreProtocol.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Store/Store.Protocol+Deinitialize.swift
rename to Sources/Store/__StoreProtocol.swift
